///   1. `IroncladCardPool.GenerateAllCards()` lists all 87 cards in
///      **alphabetical** (class-name) order.
///   2. `.Where(c => c.Type == CardType.Attack)` → 37 attacks.
///   3. `CardFactory.FilterForCombat` drops `!CanBeGeneratedInCombat`
