///      removing Bash (Basic), Break (Ancient), StrikeIronclad (Basic),
///      and Feed (`CanBeGeneratedInCombat => false`) → **33** attacks.
///   4. `TakeRandom(count)` = `UnstableShuffle(theWholeList).Take(count)`.
